      "SANDRA: I'll be right back...\nAMY: Could you join us, please?",
      "AMY: All right...the camera follows you in. You see the dog, you see the message... where “Humans Can Lick, Too\" is She points to the MIRROR, scr…\nAMY: Then you turn around, and -- BAM! ~~ you see the killer and scream. Got it?\nAMY I: Okay, everybody ready...? Roll sound.",
      "AMY: No...this isn't right. Something's wrong, I know it...\nREESE: What do you mean?\nAMY: She wasn't acting -- she's not that good...\nREESE: You kids work too hard...maybe you should get some rest.",
